# QA M7 acceptance: the whole journey in one run of the real game, from the
# title through Salzburg, St. Gilgen, Brunnwinkl, Falkenstein (the Hackl),
# St. Wolfgang, the Wolfgangsee, Strobl, Bad Ischl and Café Zauner (the
# Oberkellner beaten with axes) and the whole ending to the title with
# the „durchgespielt" mark, carrying the Hackl the whole way, never hurt.
# Frames 0-32083: qa_m6_accept_full_route's inputs unchanged (its notes
# below): the first eight stages, the route map Bad Ischl -> Café Zauner
# in Wait and the Café Zauner intro (32024) with the run carried over
# (Hackl, lives 7, score 154150, 22 Oblaten on the HUD).
# Café Zauner (play from 32174; clock = frame - 32174): the café inputs of
# cafe_zauner_boss_win_hackl.replay unchanged (its frames 2166-4714, so
# every café frame is that replay's + 8): an axe off Kellner #1's tray
# (32554, no points), the tray bounces up to L1, a stomp on Kurgast #1,
# Vitrine D, an axe on the third Wartender (33193, 100), L3 and six
# Wartende stomped, the checkpoint, the arena lock (33835), an axe off the
# Oberkellner's tray in his telegraph (33952), the dashes jumped, one axe
# per breather (hits 34098, 34319, 34522) and one through the stun
# (34103), the goal_stollen (34711, 10 000). Idle: the Serve, the tally
# (34801), the clear panel (34959), the ending (Map 35139, Scene 35379,
# Bill 35739, Credits 36339, Ende 37419) and the title (38019): the run
# reset to Salzburg (score 0, 3 lives, Normal) with the mark; the replay
# ends on it (38049). Shot: the marked title in the real game (38037,
# the Salzburg backdrop with „Nochmal? Drück START").
# Nine LevelCompletes, no death, no hurt, all deterministic. A new
# time_limit for Café Zauner changes its tally and moves every frame
# after 34801 (the shot too).
#
# qa_m6_accept_full_route's notes:
#   QA M6 acceptance: the whole playable journey in one run of the real game,
#   from the title through Salzburg, St. Gilgen, Brunnwinkl, Falkenstein (the
#   Hackl), St. Wolfgang, the Wolfgangsee, Strobl and Bad Ischl to the Cafe
#   Zauner intro, carrying the Hackl the whole way, never hurt.
#   Frames 0-25577: qa_m5_accept_full_route's inputs to the start of Strobl
#   play (25578, Hackl, lives 6, score 115800, 30 Oblaten).
#   Strobl (clock = frame - 25578): strobl_hackl_axes's Strobl inputs (its
#   frames 11927-13897: an axe on Nordic-Walker #1, the shutter staircase
#   #2 -> #3 -> annex as big Resi, the Postbus halt seen from shelter B, an
#   axe off the halted bus, Ampel #1 from the terrace, an axe off a car) to
#   the Gastgarten terrace (27549), then a QA beam search (8-frame chunks,
#   no hurt, power kept): Ampel #2, the Buergelstein walkway, the Ache, the
#   Lokalbahn halt; Strobl LevelComplete at 28312 as Hackl. Idle: tally,
#   route map Strobl -> Bad Ischl (Wait), no START, the Bad Ischl intro
#   (29173) and play from 29323 (Hackl, lives 6, score 134950).
#   Bad Ischl (clock = frame - 29323): QA beam search (8-frame chunks, no
#   hurt, power kept) through the Kurgaeste, the three officer files, the
#   Fiaker, the Traun notches (a hop over the D-102 kerb at 30277), the
#   Kurkapelle and the singers; an extra life on the 100th Oblate; from B2
#   (30812) a hurt-free solver beam search (power kept) over the D-102 pier
#   to the goal: Bad Ischl LevelComplete at 31174 as Hackl. Idle: tally,
#   the route map Bad Ischl -> Cafe Zauner (31660) in Wait, the Cafe Zauner
#   intro (32024) with the run carried over (Hackl, lives 7, score 154150);
#   the replay ends in the intro (32084). Re-cut for D-108 (M7): it ended
#   on the teaser and the title; Stage 9 is playable now (the whole route
#   to the ending is qa_m7_accept_full_route).
#   Re-cut for D-102 (E42): Strobl's 230 s shorten its tally by 10 frames
#   (10 idle frames fewer before Bad Ischl, whose inputs keep their clock),
#   the kerb hop, and the new route from B2 on (the old one clipped the
#   4-high pier); Bad Ischl's 210 s shorten its tally.
#   Eight LevelCompletes, no death, no hurt, all deterministic.
level  = salzburg
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
expect = complete frames=1772..1772 deaths=0 no_event=Died no_event=Hurt no_event=GameOver event=AxeHit event=ExtraLife event=CheckpointReached event=Stroke
expect = state=title cleared=true stage=salzburg power=normal score=0 lives=3 oblaten=0
shots  = 38037:title_cleared
